# Planr Design Review

1. Run `planr pipeline design-review <slug>` and serve the existing finalized
   artifact through the loopback review board.
2. Consume only the board's feedback file. Regenerate the pinned screen or
   section, not the whole artifact, and keep the design lint gate at zero
   errors after each change.
3. Sync the selected result into the design specification and design manifest
   through the engine-owned workflow.
4. Sharing and review-URL import are separate actions and never imply
   publication.
5. Report the applied feedback, remaining design issues, and PLAN as an
   optional next action. Do not invoke PLAN or SHIP automatically.
